ities and opportunities.\n\n👑 Earn the Monarch's trust through loyalty and service... or gather influence, seize the throne, and rule the realm yourself.\n\n🔥 Govern wisely, for a neglected Kingdom may revolt against your reign and claim the Crown for another.\n\n─────────「🏰」─────────\n\n⚠️・Rise To Royalty is currently in Open Beta. Expect bugs, glitches, balance changes, and unfinished content as we continue expanding the Kingdom with regular updates.\n\n📜・This game is a fantasy experience and is not intended to be historically accurate.","path":"/game/18809158765-rise-to-royalty","slug":"18809158765-rise-to-royalty","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/a10388b75aa611dd6cbefa93f2b39862ae810facaa2111410624f64af7eaed06.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-7a0ec02e98fc30b4998b679cc1d4cc56/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":6,"visitor":16638968,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-09-11T05:30:06.536Z","creator":{"name":"Rise To Royalty","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":4,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":1,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":98209635344835,"name":"The Hatch","desc":"The Hatch wasn’t just another egg hunt. It was the largest ever built on Roblox. It was an adventure that brought 100s of experiences together to challenge the savviest players to find 100s of elemental eggs and collectively hatch one from out of this world.","path":"/game/98209635344835-the-hatch","slug":"98209635344835-the-hatch","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6444a8b67ad713b59316196d7380a900e1c385b0acf758e39545bf9132c10ad8.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-648cbb2e44cebcc83241a2b76170ba0a/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":6,"visitor":166089278,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-07-10T15:32:36.759Z","creator":{"name":"Roblox Presents","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":5,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":87638937916386,"name":"The Fields [UPDATE]","desc":"30-09-2026\nv0.4.1 - Fresh Coat of Paint\n\n\"Life rots quickest where it grows fastest.\"\n\nMonths have passed since HEMCOR sealed off The [REDACTED] Fields. The news won't stop circling the story, speaking only of HEMCOR and their explanations as “irregularities in agricultural life” and the need for “further study.”\n\nBut you don't trust them.\nAnd for reasons that are known only to you, you step into the quarantine zone.\n\nM - View controls (PC)\n\nThis game is in early access, expect a few bugs.\nEVERYTHING IN THE GAME IS SUBJECT TO CHANGE.\n\nThe Fields is inspired by @Octik's \"TRAVERSAL\", Acid Wizard Studio's \"Darkwood\", and Badorkbee's \"Isle\".","path":"/game/87638937916386-the-fields","slug":"87638937916386-the-fields","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/73e89f1534b44b912288a6eb4c898988c9283a876cd8c5121a09c5726945fe37.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-d45d9e8e478431fc4aa04904cc8d0652/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":6,"visitor":3244423,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2026-09-07T20:24:32.851Z","creator":{"name":"Not-a-Social Studio","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":5,"freeCount":4,"keyCount":0,"verifiedCount":0}},{"id":81202316929048,"name":"[UPD] Be a Ninja","desc":"⚔️Be A Ninja ⚔️\n\nDo you have what it takes to become the strongest ninja? Gain Skill Points every second, and upgrade your stats in order to defeat ninjas and other players..\n\nHow To Play:\n🔥Gain Skill Points\n💵 Spend Skill Points on upgrades! \n⚒️ Upgrade your weapons!\n⚔️ Defeat NPC's and Players!\n🪽 Rebirth to unlock new weapons, areas, and other perks!","path":"/game/81202316929048-be-a-ninja","slug":"81202316929048-be-a-ninja","thumbnail":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/20c1472f9c7e8e3cd8bd77ccf0c079306eab7d2bff2dffef414b00f6342a50a4.webp","original":"https://tr.rbxcdn.com/180DAY-6570a98eaa2a5c45eab75ef8dd3023bc/150/150/Image/Png/noFilter"},"playing":6,"visitor":33565253,"verified":false,"updatedAt":"2025-10-22T19:29:38.765Z","creator":{"name":"Game Squared 2","type":"Group"},"script":{"count":6,"freeCount":6,"keyCount":2,"verifiedCount